🎓 SUMMARY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

• Aliases simplify query results and make SQL more readable.
• Column aliases rename output columns, table aliases shorten references.
• AS is optional but recommended.
• Quotes are required for aliases with spaces.
• Use aliases with expressions, functions, joins, and subqueries.
• Aliases last only for the current query.

